<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 4.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 4.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.53    5.15</p>
<p> 2   Hills Inds	     13.33    1.95</p>
<p> 3   MT Leyshon Gold	10.68    2.34</p>
<p> 4   Indu Property	   9.89    0.92</p>
<p> 5   Aust Tour		 9.74    0.77</p>
<p> 6   Prime Credit Tr	 9.70    1.01</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   9.60    1.70</p>
<p> 8   Prop Income Inv	 9.41    1.08</p>
<p> 9   Villa World	     9.40    1.17</p>
<p>10   Spotless Svc	    9.24    1.19</p>
<p>11   Centro Prop	     8.99    2.17</p>
<p>12   Gandel Retail Tr	8.86    0.88</p>
<p>13   Colonial Mutual	 8.76    1.18</p>
<p>14   Barclays Mirvac	 8.40    1.31</p>
